  {
    "id": "e553009a-d9df-4275-9663-cef70f4404a5",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 98,
    "endS": 107.6,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "But also, I really want people to be creative and be kind to themselves.",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T23:55:39.571Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "363e0c4a-e1f9-4a1c-b4fc-fd9dbe2e34d7",
    "videoName": "A001C004_240718BC",
    "startS": 119.8,
    "endS": 130.5,
    "kind": "interview",
    "relevance": "",
    "notes": "I think that there's a pressure to produce things. As a creative person, but not to be kind of kind to yourself about what the process is going to be like,",
    "tags": [],
    "source": "manual",
    "starred": true,
    "excluded": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-18T23:55:39.571Z"
  },
  {
